  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Spring Among The Living**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **It's About Twilight Now**: back after 22 archived shows (1000 days) [3]\n- **Old September Blues**: back after 70 archived shows (1455 days) [3]\n- **Lowdown**: back after 36 archived shows (1041 days) [3]\n- **Big Decisions**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **I Think I'm Going to Hell**: back after 22 archived shows (1000 days) [3]\n- **Easy Morning Rebel**: back after 21 archived shows (893 days) [3]\n- **Dondante**: back after 22 archived shows (1000 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2015-06-10** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 141 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show ran as two sets split by a short break, with no encores. One song drew a 'Let's Go Hawks!' crowd chant [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2015-06-10**: taped by Kelly Casey; transferred by Kelly Casey; source: FOB Slightly right of center 5th row balcony SP-BMC-2 Binaural microphones on my hat > SP-SPSB-11 Battery Box > Tascam DR-100mkII > SDHC 16/44 [1]. Also: Transfer went from SDHC card to PC, through Audacity, and out as FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Status Serigraph: [2015 My Morning Jacket - Chicago II Silkscreen Concert Poster by Guy Burwell](https://www.jojosposters.com/products/2015-my-morning-jacket-chicago-ii-silkscreen-concert-poster-by-guy-burwell) [4]",
